<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FNPS Gusau | Excellence in Education</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Welcome to FNPS Gusau. Discover our school, facilities, activities, leadership and learning community.">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#073b82">

    <style>
        :root {
            --blue: #073b82;
            --deep: #031d46;
            --light-blue: #eaf2ff;
            --gold: #f5bd45;
            --white: #fff;
            --text: #17243b;
            --muted: #64748b;
            --light: #f5f8fd;
            --border: #e3eaf4;
            --shadow: 0 15px 45px rgba(7,59,130,.12);
            --radius: 22px;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 90px; }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: var(--text);
            background: white;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        body.menu-open, body.lightbox-open { overflow: hidden; }

        img, video { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
        a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
        button { font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }

        .container { width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 36px)); margin: auto; }
        .section { padding: 80px 0; }
        .section-light { background: var(--light); }

        .section-heading {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-block;
            color: var(--blue);
            background: var(--light-blue);
            padding: 7px 15px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.2; }

        .section-heading h2 {
            color: var(--deep);
            font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 43px);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .section-heading p { color: var(--muted); }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 13px 22px;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: .25s;
        }

        .btn-primary { color: white; background: var(--blue); }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--deep); transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .btn-gold { color: var(--deep); background: var(--gold); }
        .btn-outline { color: var(--blue); border: 1px solid var(--blue); background: transparent; }

        /* HEADER */

        .header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.97);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }

        .header-inner {
            min-height: 80px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; }
        .brand img { width: 52px; height: 52px; object-fit: contain; }
        .brand strong { display: block; color: var(--blue); font-size: 17px; }
        .brand small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; }

        .desktop-nav { display: none; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }
        .desktop-nav a { color: #34445e; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
        .desktop-nav a:hover { color: var(--blue); }

        .header-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .header-login { display: none; }

        .menu-button {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            border-radius: 13px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: white;
            color: var(--blue);
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        /* MOBILE MENU */

        .drawer-backdrop {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 1100;
            background: rgba(3,20,48,.58);
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transition: .25s;
        }

        .drawer {
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 1200;
            top: 0;
            right: 0;
            width: min(340px, 88%);
            height: 100%;
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            transform: translateX(100%);
            transition: transform .3s;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        body.menu-open .drawer-backdrop { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }
        body.menu-open .drawer { transform: translateX(0); }

        .drawer-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .drawer-top strong { color: var(--blue); font-size: 19px; }

        .drawer-close {
            border: 0;
            background: var(--light-blue);
            color: var(--blue);
            border-radius: 12px;
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            font-size: 25px;
        }

        .drawer-links { display: grid; gap: 5px; }
        .drawer-links a { padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #33445f; }
        .drawer-links a:hover { background: var(--light-blue); color: var(--blue); }
        .drawer-login { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }

        /* HERO SLIDESHOW */

        .hero {
            min-height: 610px;
            position: relative;
            isolation: isolate;
            overflow: hidden;
            color: white;
            background: var(--deep);
        }

        .hero-slides, .hero-slide {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
        }

        .hero-slide {
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: scale(1.04);
            transition: opacity 1.2s ease, transform 7s ease;
        }

        .hero-slide.active {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: scale(1);
        }

        .hero::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: -1;
            background:
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(2,20,51,.91), rgba(4,37,83,.70) 55%, rgba(4,37,83,.38)),
                linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(2,20,51,.50), transparent);
        }

        .hero-inner {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            min-height: 610px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding-top: 65px;
            padding-bottom: 80px;
        }

        .hero-content { max-width: 720px; }

        .hero-label {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.13);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 23px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(38px, 8vw, 68px);
            letter-spacing: -1.8px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .hero h1 span { color: var(--gold); }

        .hero-content > p {
            max-width: 600px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.86);
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero-buttons { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
        .hero .btn-outline { color: white; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); }

        .hero-bottom { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; }
        .hero-pill { padding: 9px 13px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }

        .hero-dots {
            position: absolute;
            z-index: 3;
            bottom: 25px;
            left: max(18px, calc((100% - 1160px) / 2));
            display: flex;
            gap: 9px;
        }

        .hero-dot {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.5);
        }

        .hero-dot.active { background: var(--gold); transform: scale(1.25); }

        /* ABOUT */

        .about-grid { display: grid; gap: 30px; }

        .about-visual {
            min-height: 300px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #073b82, #031d46);
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            padding: 30px;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about-visual img {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            object-fit: contain;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 9px;
            margin: 0 auto 18px;
        }

        .about-visual h3 { font-size: 25px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .about-copy h3 { font-size: 26px; color: var(--deep); margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .about-copy p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 15px; }

        .feature-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-top: 22px; }
        .feature { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 35px;
            height: 35px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            color: var(--blue);
            background: var(--light-blue);
            border-radius: 11px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .feature strong { display: block; color: var(--deep); font-size: 14px; }
        .feature span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }

        /* LEADERSHIP AND HISTORY */

        .leader-grid { display: grid; gap: 25px; }

        .leader-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .leader-photo {
            min-height: 220px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dce9fb, #f1f6ff);
            color: var(--blue);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .leader-photo span { display: block; font-size: 45px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .leader-photo small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }

        .leader-body { padding: 25px; }
        .leader-body h3 { font-size: 22px; color: var(--deep); margin-bottom: 5px; }

        .leader-role {
            color: var(--blue);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: .8px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .leader-body p, .history-box p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; }

        .history-box {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .history-box h3 { font-size: 25px; color: var(--deep); margin-bottom: 18px; }

        .history-note {
            display: inline-block;
            color: #855b00;
            background: #fff6df;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* FACILITIES */

        .facility-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }

        .facility-card {
            border-radius: 18px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            transition: .25s;
        }

        .facility-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }

        .facility-image {
            height: 210px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e4edff, #f4f8ff);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .facility-image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform .5s;
        }

        .facility-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.06); }
        .facility-card h3 { color: var(--deep); padding: 17px 18px 20px; font-size: 17px; }

        /* GALLERY */

        .gallery-controls {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .gallery-tab {
            padding: 11px 22px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 50px;
            background: white;
            color: var(--blue);
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .gallery-tab.active { background: var(--blue); color: white; border-color: var(--blue); }

        .gallery-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }

        .gallery-item {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(7,59,130,.06);
            transition: transform .3s, box-shadow .3s;
        }

        .gallery-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(7,59,130,.20);
        }

        .gallery-item[hidden] { display: none; }

        .gallery-media {
            position: relative;
            height: 260px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #dce9fb;
        }

        .gallery-media img, .gallery-media video {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
            background: #eaf2ff;
        }

        .gallery-media img {
            cursor: zoom-in;
            transition: transform .45s, filter .35s;
        }

        .gallery-item:hover .gallery-media img {
            transform: scale(1.045);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(0,100,255,.55));
        }

        .gallery-media::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            border: 0 solid rgba(0,100,255,0);
            transition: border .3s, box-shadow .3s;
        }

        .gallery-item:hover .gallery-media::after {
            border: 4px solid rgba(0,100,255,.45);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 25px rgba(0,100,255,.25);
        }

        .gallery-caption { padding: 17px 18px; }
        .gallery-caption h3 { color: var(--deep); font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .gallery-caption p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }

        .gallery-caption .view-hint {
            display: block;
            color: var(--blue);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        /* IMAGE LIGHTBOX */

        .lightbox {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 2000;
            background: rgba(1,10,28,.94);
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 65px 15px 25px;
        }

        .lightbox.open { display: flex; }

        .lightbox-content {
            width: min(1100px, 100%);
            height: min(82vh, 850px);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .lightbox img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: calc(82vh - 55px);
            width: auto;
            height: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(0,100,255,.22);
        }

        .lightbox-caption { color: white; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; }

        .lightbox-close, .lightbox-prev, .lightbox-next {
            position: absolute;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
        }

        .lightbox-close {
            top: 15px;
            right: 18px;
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        .lightbox-prev, .lightbox-next {
            top: 50%;
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            font-size: 25px;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
        }

        .lightbox-prev { left: 15px; }
        .lightbox-next { right: 15px; }

        /* PORTAL */

        .login-section { color: white; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #05285a, #073b82); }
        .login-section .section-heading h2 { color: white; }
        .login-section .section-heading p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }

        .login-grid { display: grid; gap: 20px; }

        .login-card {
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17);
        }

        .login-icon {
            width: 55px;
            height: 55px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.13);
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-size: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .login-card h3 { font-size: 23px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .login-card p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 23px; }

        /* FOOTER */

        .footer { background: #031b3d; color: white; padding: 55px 0 25px; }
        .footer-grid { display: grid; gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 35px; }

        .footer-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .footer-brand img { width: 52px; height: 52px; object-fit: contain; background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 5px; }
        .footer-brand strong { font-size: 17px; }
        .footer p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.68); font-size: 13px; }
        .footer h3 { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .footer-links { display: grid; gap: 9px; }
        .footer-links a { color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size: 13px; }
        .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

        .footer-bottom {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
            padding-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .footer-bottom p { font-size: 11px; }

        /* RESPONSIVE */

        @media (min-width: 650px) {
            .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; align-items: center; }
            .leader-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .facility-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .login-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr; }
            .footer-bottom { flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-between; }
        }

        @media (min-width: 1000px) {
            .desktop-nav { display: flex; }
            .header-login { display: inline-flex; }
            .menu-button { display: none; }
            .facility-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
            .gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
            .section { padding: 100px 0; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 520px) {
            .hero { min-height: 590px; }
            .hero-inner { min-height: 590px; }
            .gallery-media { height: 230px; }
            .lightbox-prev { left: 5px; }
            .lightbox-next { right: 5px; }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after {
                transition-duration: .01ms !important;
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="header">
    <div class="container header-inner">

        <a href="#home" class="brand">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/school-logo.jpeg') }}" alt="FNPS Gusau logo">
            <div>
                <strong>FNPS Gusau</strong>
                <small>Learning • Character • Excellence</small>
            </div>
        </a>

        <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#leadership">Leadership</a>
            <a href="#history">History</a>
            <a href="#facilities">Facilities</a>
            <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="header-actions">
            <a href="{{ route('parent.login') }}" class="btn btn-primary header-login">Parent Login</a>
            <button class="menu-button" id="menuButton" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
        </div>

    </div>
</header>

<div class="drawer-backdrop" id="drawerBackdrop"></div>

<aside class="drawer" id="mobileDrawer" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="drawer-top">
        <strong>FNPS Gusau</strong>
        <button class="drawer-close" id="drawerClose" aria-label="Close menu">×</button>
    </div>

    <nav class="drawer-links">
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About Our School</a>
        <a href="#leadership">Head Teacher</a>
        <a href="#history">School History</a>
        <a href="#kukah">Rev. Dr. Hassan Matthew Kukah</a>
        <a href="#facilities">Facilities</a>
        <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
        <a href="#portal">Parent and Staff Portal</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="drawer-login">
        <a href="{{ route('parent.login') }}" class="btn btn-primary">Parent / Guardian Login</a>
        <a href="{{ route('staff.login') }}" class="btn btn-outline">Staff Login</a>
    </div>
</aside>

<main>

    <!-- HERO BACKGROUND SLIDESHOW -->

    <section class="hero" id="home">

        <div class="hero-slides" aria-hidden="true">

            <div class="hero-slide active"
                 style="background-image:url('{{ asset('images/school_vicinity.jpeg') }}')"></div>

            <div class="hero-slide"
                 style="background-image:url('{{ asset('images/school_vicinity2.jpeg') }}')"></div>

            <div class="hero-slide"
                 style="background-image:url('{{ asset('images/school_vicinity3.jpeg') }}')"></div>

        </div>

        <div class="container hero-inner">

            <div class="hero-content">

                <div class="hero-label">✦ Welcome to FNPS Gusau</div>

                <h1>Building Bright Minds.<br><span>Shaping Tomorrow.</span></h1>

                <p>
                    Welcome to FNPS Gusau, a school community committed
                    to learning, character development, discovery and
                    helping every child grow into their potential.
                </p>

                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <a href="#about" class="btn btn-gold">Discover Our School →</a>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="btn btn-outline">Explore Gallery</a>
                </div>

                <div class="hero-bottom">
                    <div class="hero-pill">📚 Learning</div>
                    <div class="hero-pill">🌱 Character</div>
                    <div class="hero-pill">⭐ Excellence</div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="hero-dots" id="heroDots" aria-label="Choose background image">
            <button class="hero-dot active" aria-label="Show background 1"></button>
            <button class="hero-dot" aria-label="Show background 2"></button>
            <button class="hero-dot" aria-label="Show background 3"></button>
        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- ABOUT -->

    <section class="section" id="about">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-heading">
                <span class="eyebrow">About FNPS Gusau</span>
                <h2>A Community of Learning and Growth</h2>
                <p>Discover our school, our values and our commitment to nurturing young learners.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-grid">

                <div class="about-visual">
                    <div>
                        <img src="{{ asset('images/second-school-logo.jpeg') }}" alt="FNPS Gusau school emblem">
                        <h3>FNPS Gusau</h3>
                        <p>Inspiring learning.<br>Developing character.<br>Creating opportunities.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="about-copy">
                    <h3>Education with Purpose</h3>

                    <p>
                        At FNPS Gusau, we believe education should help children
                        develop academically, socially and personally. Our school
                        community seeks to provide an environment where pupils
                        learn, ask questions, build confidence and discover
                        their abilities.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Through classroom learning, school activities and
                        partnership between teachers, parents and guardians,
                        we aim to support responsible, curious and confident learners.
                    </p>

                    <div class="feature-list">
